is, she really wants a car. At the junkyard she&nbsp;
finds this old yellow Beetle, takes it home to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:54.960 --> 00:10:58.620
fix it up and whoa, my car's an alien!
She and Bumblebee become fast friends,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:58.620 --> 00:11:01.800
in fact she's the one who names him Bumblebee.&nbsp;
And she's the one that helps him figure out&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:01.800 --> 00:11:05.340
that he can talk using the radio. So they're&nbsp;
cruising around getting up to shenanigans,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:05.340 --> 00:11:09.360
but John Cena is the Sector Seven agent here&nbsp;
to hunt him down, and also a couple more&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:09.360 --> 00:11:12.960
Decepticons are here to destroy the world.
So in the end, Bumblebee’s having a robot fight&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:12.960 --> 00:11:16.860
while Charlie's running around doing the plot&nbsp;
thing. But what's this, Bumblebee is going to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:16.860 --> 00:11:20.580
drown! Luckily, her backstory is that she was,&nbsp;
like, a really good diver, until her dad died, now&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:20.580 --> 00:11:24.720
she doesn't dive anymore. But now she overcomes&nbsp;
her fear and dives in there to save his life.
&nbsp;

00:11:24.720 --> 00:11:28.620
Although, of course, he's a robot that doesn't&nbsp;
breathe air, and I mean, in the last movie he rode&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:28.620 --> 00:11:32.340
a submarine to the bottom of the ocean. Anyway,&nbsp;
John Cena accepts that Bumblebee’s a good guy now,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:32.340 --> 00:11:35.100
but the government’s still hunting him,&nbsp;
so they have to say goodbye. He finds&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:35.100 --> 00:11:38.880
a cool old Camaro to be his new disguise,&nbsp;
to eventually be found by Sam Witwicky.
&nbsp;

